WEBVTT

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.880
Did you know someone
confessed to Sachiko?

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.810
Really? Who did?

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:44.750
A guy from the regular trip.

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:51.600
How am I supposed to sleep
with all this chatter?

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:53.720
Elis-chan?

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.330
Is something wrong?

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:57.840
No.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.250
I'm going to sleep. Good night.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.270
Good night.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:15.680
Hey.

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:19.460
Do you think childhood friends
really are special?

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.790
What are you talking about?

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.820
Onii-chan and Kiri-san.

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:25.040
Oh, Kikyo-sensei?

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.760
I was just thinking Kiri-san must
be important to Onii-chan.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:33.600
Your Onii-chan must be
special to you, too.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.930
Of course he is.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:38.470
I've loved him since I was little.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.810
Do you love him as a brother...

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:42.800
or as a man?

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:46.940
Hey, what are you girls
still doing awake?

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.110
Go to sleep already!

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.510
You've got to get up early tomorrow!

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:53.470
Okay.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.820
That's not going to help me sleep.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:04.830
Sand Beige Sea Roar

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.070
Come on, wake up.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.240
We'll be late for breakfast.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.230
Okay.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:22.750
Onii-chan, just a little longer.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:34.420
Fujinami, where is Elis... Hosen?

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.560
She hasn't been awake since she said...

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.380
“Onii-chan, just a little longer.”

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.360
What?

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:40.800
I'm coming in.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:45.530
Come on, Elis! How long are
you going to keep sleeping?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.240
Just a little longer.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.080
Absolutely not.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.960
Everyone's already eating breakfast.

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:53.040
I'm so tired...

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:57.460
You know we're not at home.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.300
Then I'll go home.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:03:59.980
What?

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:03.150
If I go home, I can have
you all to myself.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.570
Wake up.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.420
Now we'll begin the competition
between...

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:19.600
the select sophomore students
and the junior major students.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:21.690
Bow.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.970
Thank you.

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:37.510
Hosen-san.

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:43.290
They've all been looking for the missing
ace attacker of the freshman team.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.920
Shota-kun, what have you been up to?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:48.900
I've been gathering clay. What a haul.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:51.560
The second game has already started.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.740
I'm getting destroyed,
so there's no point.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:55.880
But it's not decided yet.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.490
I'm not talking about beach volley ball.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:58.560
What, then?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:03.750
I don't think you'd understand
the nuances of a girl's heart.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.920
Why not?

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:07.080
Just forget it. Go away.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.470
Hey.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.660
What? Do you want something else?

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.960
Let's get some shaved ice.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.070
What?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.700
I can't do it.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.700
What an amazing attack!

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:32.170
Brain freeze!

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:34.160
But why shaved ice?

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:39.120
You seemed pretty angry, so I thought
you might want to cool off.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.540
Brain freeze!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:51.380
Hosen-san, you're just like bizenyaki.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.800
Bizenyaki?

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:56.700
It's rough and ragged, but that's
what's good about it.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:59.340
I'll leave these here.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.270
This is it.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:03.210
I'm this?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.140
Hey!

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:06.370
What are you doing over here?

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:09.790
Elis, cut it out already! You can't
just do what you want.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:10.820
Kamikura-sensei.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.750
I invited her to get shaved ice.

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:17.150
I'm sorry.

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:20.190
Fine.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.300
Let's go.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:32.300
And the winners are the
junior major students!

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.780
Hosen-san, if you had been here...

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:40.780
we might have made it all
the way to first place.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:45.680
I guess Hashizume-kun is more
important than winning.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:46.480
What?

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.240
I heard you two disappeared together.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:53.780
I guess the two of you might get along.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.440
I'm so jealous.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.160
There's nothing to be jealous about.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:09.340
Hosen-san.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:10.580
President.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.270
Are you ready?

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:13.010
Huh?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.280
For the test of courage.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:19.730
It was so bad, for a while all I could
write were horror stories.

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:25.340
This year's freshmen have
a lot to contend with.

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:28.550
Sophomores, juniors, don't
go too hard on them.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.630
Well, I'm getting out now.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:33.590
Elis-chan, Elis-chan.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:36.360
Seems like there's been
a new development.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.300
What?

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.350
Your Onii-chan and your classmate...

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:44.560
How does it feel to have your heart
waver between two men?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.710
There's nothing going on.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:48.330
But everyone's talking about it.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.650
I don't care about that.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.120
I feel like I'm going to pass out.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.670
Call a teacher!

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:00.670
Onii-chan!

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:03.060
You can't call your Onii-chan.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.110
Are you okay?

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:10.000
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.600
Why don't you rest here for a while?

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.030
I will do that.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.470
Well, I'm going to the
outdoor hot spring.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.670
Okay.

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:20.950
See you later.

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.750
Oh, Elis-chan.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:31.690
Hiroki was just complaining about you.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.900
He said you're acting rebellious...

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:38.050
and now you've got someone who
might be your boyfriend.

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:42.600
He went on and on like an old geezer.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.300
Onii-chan talks to you about
everything, doesn't he?

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.570
Huh? Well, he always has.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.070
What's wrong?

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.770
Is there something you can't
talk to Hiroki about?

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:56.720
Is it about your boyfriend?

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.220
Did you have a boyfriend when
you were in high school?

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.160
Uh, well, not really...

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.090
Did you like anyone?

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:09.960
You did.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.060
I did, but...

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.330
But?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.670
He turned me down.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.590
I finally got up the courage
to tell him, but he said no.

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.340
Was that...

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.140
I'm getting out.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:45.900
Onii-chan.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:50.640
Elis, I told you not to call me Onii-chan.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.770
Sorry I'm so rebellious.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.820
Did Kiri tell you about that?

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.450
Yes, among other things.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.540
What other things?

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.660
About how she confessed
her love to someone...

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.280
who turned her down in high school.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.000
I didn't turn her down.

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.390
Then what?

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:13.450
I just wanted to stay friends with her.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:16.580
Besides, she was pretty popular...

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:19.400
and figured she deserved
someone better.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:20.660
Don't you think so?

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:24.800
There are other men who
are better suited for her.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.170
Onii-chan.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.890
I told you, don't call me Onii-chan.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:33.140
Later.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:51.500
I'm going to let go.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:00.660
That's amazing, Elis.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:01.710
You're swimming.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.140
Good job, Elis-chan!

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:08.330
It's because I'm so good at teaching.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.050
What are you talking about?

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.850
It's because of Elis' effort!

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.350
As a reward, I'll treat you
to some ice cream.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.410
What's wrong, Elis?

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:32.470
Onii-chan has liked Kiri-san since then...

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.360
and Kiri-san liked him back...

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:48.250
We will now begin the Nadesico
Academy test of courage.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:53.850
Freshmen pair up, follow
the route to the shrine...

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.660
and then come back here.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:59.500
The sophomores and juniors will
be waiting for you as ghosts...

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.730
but don't give up.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.430
Muster your courage, and let's go.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.450
First group, start!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.570
Okay.

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:11.180
See you soon.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.560
See you soon.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:23.530
I wonder how many we can scare stiff!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.290
This will be fun...

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:28.560
I'm looking forward to it, too.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:30.690
Kana-san.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:34.900
That isn't scary. It's cute.

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.420
Sumire-chan, I can't tell who you are...

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.570
I did my best to set up traps.

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:43.910
I have konjac and a lantern.

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:47.110
Look, its mouth moves.

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:52.580
I don't understand what I'm
supposed to be doing.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:54.190
Let's see.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:57.080
Yamakawa-kun from the boys, and
Fujinami-san from the girls!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:57.760
Okay.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:13:00.390
No fair, Tomoko-chan. You're going first?

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:03.290
You can go first if you want, Elis-chan.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:04.800
But that's scary.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.260
Okay, okay. I'll go first, then.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:08.830
What?

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:11.340
Hey, wait!

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:15.320
I guess girls are the brave
ones these days.

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:18.580
What are you scared for?

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.010
They'll do this next year too, won't they?

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:25.840
If I had known about this, I wouldn't
have come to Nadesico.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.840
Oh, really?

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:31.800
Sensei, that's deafening!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.830
You're not in any condition
to be running things.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.070
Give me the mic.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:37.030
Sorry.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:48.470
Next we have Hashizume from the
boys, Hosen from the girls.

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.900
It's that couple everyone's talking about.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.310
Hashizume, you planned this, didn't you?

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.900
Good to see you.

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:55.250
Good to see you.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:56.960
Good luck!

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:06.530
Are you okay?

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:09.270
Tell me if you're too scared to go on.

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:10.930
Right back at you.

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.990
That... That...

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.140
Stop messing around.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:27.500
Let's go.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:30.470
Okay.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.950
We're back.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.320
And Yamakawa's arrived.

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:38.090
Are you here, Fujinami-san?

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.430
Yes.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:42.720
Fujinami-san has arrived, too.

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.080
Now we're just waiting
for Elis and Shota.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.270
Kikyo-sensei!

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.230
What?

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:48.940
Aren't you a freshman, too?

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:50.740
This is your first year at Nadesico.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:51.380
What?

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.520
Hey, yeah.

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.110
Why don't you go test your courage, too?

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:58.710
Wait, I...

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.050
All right, let's go!

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.700
Misaki-senpai looks like she's having fun.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:26.190
Looks like you got quite the partner.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.040
Help me!

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.450
Elis-chan, what's wrong?

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:40.640
Hosen-san?

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.260
You overdid it!

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:45.620
Sorry!

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:50.810
Hey, are you okay, Hosen-san?

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.740
No one told me I'd be doing this!

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.640
Stop complaining.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.930
There's a shortcut this way.

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:04.140
Okay.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:05.890
Can you walk?

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.080
I'm fine.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.310
Let's go.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.600
Was the umbrella really that scary?

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:22.540
It was red.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.360
What?

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.770
Are you okay?

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:27.890
Yeah.

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.500
There's nothing scary about ghosts.

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:38.490
I'll protect you if something happens.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:42.820
You were way more scared than me.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:44.610
What?

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:48.850
That's the first time I've
seen you smile today.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.730
Hey.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.900
Huh?

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:04.920
I didn't want to do this!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.360
This isn't scary at all.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:11.900
Hagino, this is a test of courage,
not a cosplay convention.

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:15.510
If I have to wear something,
I wanted it to be cute.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.380
Am I scary?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.040
Misaki?

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:21.980
Bingo.

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:23.100
I can't do this any more.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:23.890
Kiri.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.390
I'm leaving!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.820
Don't be ridiculous.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:27.600
I'm leaving!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:31.130
If you cut through there, you'll find
the return path from the shrine.

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.800
I guess we'll have to take a shortcut.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.070
Kiri, can you stand?

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.000
Barely...

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:40.840
Come on, let's go.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.610
Okay.

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:48.220
Are you okay?

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.290
Yeah, sorry...

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:54.790
I can't believe you caused
so much trouble.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:57.000
Because I...

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:00.910
Hey.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:01.850
What?

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.790
Are you really going to
become a teacher?

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:07.860
Yeah, I'm planning on taking
the employment exam.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.880
I see. I guess that could work.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.270
If we work in the same field...

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.640
we can help each other and listen
to each other's complaints.

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:16.710
Yeah. It could work.

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:23.810
What is Elis doing here?

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:24.770
Wait.

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:29.890
What? If you have something
to say, say it.

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:31.690
Uh, right.

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.030
What is it?

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:37.840
Hosen, do you like anyone?

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:38.800
What?

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.580
Well, you know, I...

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:45.340
I like you, Hosen!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.980
Will you go out with me?

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:03.190
He turned me down.

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:07.000
I finally got up the courage
to tell him, but he said no.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.350
Hosen?

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:17.100
No...

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.510
Hosen?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.080
Sorry about that. Just forget it!

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:25.310
Let's just go, okay?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.800
Hiroki, Hiroki.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:30.580
Huh?

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.380
Oh, sorry.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:41.120
It's okay. Hashizume's a good kid.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:41.860
Yeah.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.820
Elis-chan sure is popular.

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:46.330
Yeah, but don't you think it's too soon...

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.710
for that kind of thing?

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:50.280
What are you talking about? We...

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:16.520
{}

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.910
Sorry, just forget it!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.910
Kikyo Kiri, returning to her post.

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:57.800
Kamikura-sensei, don't forget
you're still at work.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:00.150
Sure.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.740
Kamikura Hiroki, returning
to his post, too.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:08.000
All that excitement made me hungry.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.260
You're going to eat more?

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:10.480
Why shouldn't I?

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:12.560
Aren't you worried about this?

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.580
Don't squeeze it!

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:12.740
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:15.940
Why do men fall for women in yukatas?

00:23:15.940 --> 00:23:18.990
That sexy back of the neck...

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:20.330
that mature look in her eye...

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.710
and the fresh style is a
good change of pace.

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.910
Then I'll wear something
new at home every day.

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:28.490
Nurse outfits, bunny girl outfits...

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:31.460
I'm looking for a more subtle sexiness.

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:34.240
Next episode, “Midnight
Blue Melancholy.”

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:37.000
Cosplay is great for spicing
up your love life!
